	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"eval", exp="g.no124=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030180"},
		{"eval", exp="f.no154=1"},
		{"eval", exp="g.no124=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030250"},
		line=1846,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"As soon as we dash out of the concert venue, a deafening screech across the sky has us ducking for cover.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aaaahhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What the heck is that!?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“An attack aircraft...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"No sooner than the whisper leaves my mouth does a faraway rumbling resonate in the pit of my stomach.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The ominous rumbling continues until it becomes one constant roar.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"In the distance, bright red flames begin to lick away at the inky blue sky.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our recon unit just reported in.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yogarasu District is being bombed.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're targeting our headquarters... Do they not care about the civilians?!”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It couldn't be Elsa's doing, could it?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I want to believe it wasn't.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Should I call her to find out?",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I hesitantly take out my cell phone only to discover that I already have a missed call from her.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"I immediately dial her back.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"After several excruciatingly long rings, the call finally connects.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"But all I hear are the sounds of explosions and screams.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Could it be that she's right in the middle of Yogarasu District?",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa, can you hear me?!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun! Where are you?!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, but we're not in Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"As soon as her voice cuts off, the explosions and screams fill the void.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“So you lied to me...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wouldn't be alive right now if it wasn't for that.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Still, your intuition was on the mark.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I... I was planning on exterminating the warriors once you were in the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I knew it.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then why are you in Yogarasu─”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You there! Escape to the south! Run!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't worry about the doll! Save yourself first!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Elsa screams in desperation.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Is she evacuating the civilians?!",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"The deafening sound of an explosion erupts in my eardrum.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa?!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“*Cough cough...!* *Cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Get the hell out of there!”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll be fine. I'm─”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa! Answer me!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"The call cuts off.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, what's happening to Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's evacuating civilians in Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why?! Isn't it her own people doing the bombing?!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Did she just happen to be there when the bombs started dropping?",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Or did she rush to Yogarasu District because of the bombing?",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Either way, Elsa is desperately trying to save Imperial lives without any regard for her own.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm going to devote my fealty to the last and final modicum of virtue left within me.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You could say that the fealty demanded of a soldier is to loyally serve their country, but to me, that's never been what matters most.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Elsa has laid absolutely everything on the line.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Her actions speak for themselves.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"If I'm being honest, the thought of leaving her all alone at a time like this gives me pause.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"But my duty lies before me within the walls of the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"What should I do?",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			select={
				"Fulfill my sworn duty.",
				"Rush to Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do we abort the operation?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, with the Republican Army in disarray, now's our chance.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Very well. We march on the Imperial Palace to strike Okonogi down!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I'll pray for Elsa's safety in Yogarasu District, but I shall do what I must.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"I'm sure that Elsa would tell me just that herself.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Our vanguard has already neutralized the guard post leading into the Republic occupation zone.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"We rush past the deserted checkpoint and make our way towards the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, I have a report!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Koyuzu falls into step beside us as we run without stopping.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Weren't you meant to be monitoring Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“With Elsa leaving the palace, I judged her to no longer pose any threat, and so I acted of my own initiative.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I see. Your report?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Approximately eighty percent of the Republican forces guarding the palace under Elsa's command have rushed to Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“The remaining forces number around two hundred, and absent their commanding officer, they are in a state of disarray.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I feel sorry for Elsa, but we can't let this opportunity slip us by.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, go on ahead of us and secure Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ma'am!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Koyuzu breaks away and disappears into the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“In that case, please allow us to take our leave as well.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“We shall commence our attack in five minutes.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Good hunting.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san leads her unit down a separate road.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Their mission is to launch a diversionary attack from the rear gate right before our assault.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"This was another contingency we planned to avoid being wiped out all at once.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Our main strike force steals through cover of darkness and arrives at the base of the main gate to the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shiinoha, you're up.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Understood, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The priestesses accompanying us begin chanting their invocations at Kotone's command.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Immediately, I feel every nerve in my body being sharpened to a razor's edge.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"The warriors around me all murmur in amazement.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This is all we are capable of, but I believe that you should find yourselves able to move slightly more swiftly than usual.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The effect will dissipate once an hour has elapsed, so please proceed with all caution.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you, Kotone. That's all the time we'll need.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, please also accept this before you set off.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Kotone hands each of us a talisman.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I call it the Kotone Special! Please wear it around your neck.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"When I do as she says, a burst of vitality surges throughout my body.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Akari gently lays her hand on Kotone's head.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, the time is upon us. May your blade be true.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just leave it to me.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, make sure you keep yourself safe before anything else.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oomikami's divine blessing be upon you all.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Kotone withdraws to the back lines.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"In that same moment, battle cries ring out from deep within the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san's unit must have successfully breached the rear gate.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, you ready?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's time. Let's pay them back double for all that happened during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Hotori shows me a relaxed grin.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"She isn't thirsting for battle in the least.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Her expression is one of casual confidence, much more at ease than during training.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The main strike force will now storm the palace!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our objective is none else but Okonogi Tokihiko. Do not allow yourself to get distracted by those of no account!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"At once, our two hundred-strong force becomes the wind.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"We warriors are no ordinary infantry.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Carrying forth the Forefather's legacy, we live only for the battlefield from the moment we are born into this world.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Even the manner in which we close the distance is entirely unlike that of any ordinary fighting force.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, don't ever leave my side.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You just focus on the battle. Don't get distracted and catch a stray bullet to the face.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"In two effortless bounds, we surge up the flight of three hundred thirty-three steps─",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"And alight upon the front gates to the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Fifty meters dead ahead, a platoon of Republican soldiers lies in wait.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Their numbers are sparse, at only around thirty men.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Disperse ranks!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"At Hotori's signal, each of us independently leaps in a different direction.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"As warriors, our greatest strength lies in our extraordinary agility.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"No matter how impressive the Republicans' guns are, they pose no threat if they can't track us effectively.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Overcome by fear, the sentries all open up, ineffectually firing blindly into the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Not a single one of their shots lands as we fall upon them from all sides.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Arcs of fresh blood soar through the air all around me.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"But by the time they splatter upon the ground, the front gates are already behind us.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"We pass through another three gates before finally arriving at the central courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Just as Koyuzu observed, the remaining Republican soldiers are unable to mount any sort of organized resistance.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Give me a casualty report!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"A voice calls out from the rear that we've suffered no casualties.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Things are going well.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, course I am.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"I reach out and wipe a thin trickle of the enemy's blood from her cheek.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine. I can take care of myself.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Akari wipes her face clean by her own hand.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, I do beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"As I grin to myself, a detachment of warriors rushes up and closes in on our position.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"It's Mutsumi-san's unit.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san herself elegantly comes to a rest right in front of us, running her thin fingers through her disheveled hair.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Apologies for the slight delay, everyone.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"She speaks as casually as when she's bringing food to our table.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Excellent work. How did you fare?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“We engaged three separate enemy units, but suffered no casualties.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It was rather anticlimactic, I must admit.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is where the real battle begins.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The main strike force will search for Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mutsumi, you secure the perimeter. Be on the lookout for enemy reinforcements.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“As you wish, chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san rallies the warriors behind her with a series of silent hand signals.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"With perfect coordination, they split into three separate detachments and post up around the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, did you really ever hang up your blade?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehehee, I wonder, now.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haaah... pardon me...!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am aware this is terribly untoward... but might I be permitted to attend to a separate matter?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Where are you going?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I wish to examine the state of the Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Kotone peers up at the two sundered halves of the colossal boulder towering over the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"The Barrier is an enormous Artifact that has protected the Empire since time immemorial.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Its magicks are said to span across every corner of the\nEmpire's lands, denying entry to all trespassers.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"But immediately before the Republic's invasion, the Barrier was inexplicably destroyed.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"In all likelihood, it was Okonogi's doing, but the exact cause remains unknown.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Very well. I'll assign you some guards.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If you run into any danger, regroup with us immediately.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes. I absolutely shall.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Hotori smiles, petting Kotone on the head.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have no time to waste. Let's move!”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"We comb through the main palace building, wary of ambushes.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Okonogi is surely aware of our raid at this point.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Kanami peers out from the shadows of a nearby corridor.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"She's being escorted by Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Err... umm... 'Onii-sama'?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We'll explain at a later time.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For now, go link up with Mutsumi outside. Keep an eye out for enemy movements.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“As you wish!”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Koyuzu dashes off like the wind.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kanami! Why did you leave your room?”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“A few moments ago, the chancellor placed a call to my room.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“He instructed me to come with the warriors to the audience chamber.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"All of us exchange uneasy looks.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“A trap?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even so, I think we should go.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"We certainly can't just ignore it.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll take the lead. If it seems like a trap, pull back right away.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By the way, is the audience chamber...”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where we talked to Okonogi back in spring.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, I remember where it is. Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Straining my senses to their limit, I surveil the entrance to the audience chamber.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"I can detect only a single person inside.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"This is no ambush.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“You needn't be so cautious.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“If I had intended to ambush you, I wouldn't have gone to the trouble of summoning you.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"A low voice resonates from across from the audience chamber.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Okonogi?!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The very same.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Come forth. We cannot speak from such a distance.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"I meet Akari's eyes, looking for a signal.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"We cautiously proceed through the cavernous chamber.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Standing upon the steps leading up to the throne, Okonogi slowly comes into view.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Half enshadowed in the writhing darkness, he less resembles a man than an apparition who has long wandered these hallowed halls.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Okonogi Tokihiko, by Imperial decree of Empress Hisui, we have come to claim your life.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Prepare thyself, chancellor.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Imperial decrees may only be issued by the Empress herself.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Is that not so, Your Highness?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Ignoring the rest of us, Okonogi addresses Akari alone.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"He makes no pretenses as to Empress Hisui's true status.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Precisely, Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's a relief to see you haven't gone senile.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You've kept this old man waiting long enough.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Okonogi slowly begins descending from the dais.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not one step further.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“One more step and you die.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"The spellblade Yoizuki clutched in her hand, Akari approaches where Okonogi stands.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Merely striking me down will do nothing to change the fate of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're telling me that it'll just fall into anarchy before getting swallowed up by the Republic, right?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You have nothing to worry about. I've already thought that far ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I see. It appears you have matured quite considerably.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The time you spent alongside Tokita Soujin did not go to waste.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"A genuine smile crosses his bloodless lips.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"He looks for all the world like an elderly man witnessing the growth of his precocious granddaughter.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Spare me the indignity of listening to you beg for your life.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Ever since the day of Empress Suou's passing, I have lived as one who has long since died.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“As I am now, death is the last thing I fear.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Then let's end this right here and now.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have places to be.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Silence.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If you think you can buy yourself─”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Silence!”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"He roars in thunderous command.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It is for this very moment that I committed the most wretched sins known to man or beast!”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I will ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"not",
{"/font"},
" be interrupted!”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Hotori is cowed into silence.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"Even the Executor of the warriors is quelled by the force of will projected by his command.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You have five minutes.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Try not to bore me.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You have my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Okonogi lets out a deep breath.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I have lived to this day as the wicked traitor who sold his own country... all for the future of this Empire and its sole legitimate heir.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Following Akari's lead, all of us wait warily on bated breath for him to continue.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“When the war began, Her Majesty and I were conducting affairs of the state in this very room.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It all happened when I left Her Majesty's side to retrieve some documents.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The ceiling above collapsed with a terrible crash.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Okonogi gestures with his cane at the ceiling directly above the throne.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It was over in an instant.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Her Majesty was already beyond all salvation, having been struck directly by the rubble.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Knowing that she was nigh unto death, Her Majesty entrusted me with her final words.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What did my mother say?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Lest the Empire come to ruin, Your Highness and the Treasures cannot be allowed under any circumstances to fall into the Republic's hands.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“To that end, she instructed that I was to instrumentalize her death however I deemed necessary.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Hence, I falsely claimed that Empress Suou had taken her own life in penance and established a false Empress in her place, all in order to safeguard the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You made me Empress in order to protect the country?”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"Okonogi nods in solemn reply.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The Republic has always uprooted the governmental structures of the nations it conquers.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“To prevent that from happening, I needed to make them believe it more prudent to keep the existing institutions intact.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Do you understand?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"Kanami returns him a look of incomprehension.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“After Empress Suou offers her own life in atonement for our defeat, who else but her own daughter emerges to succeed her?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The people would surely throw their fanatical support behind this new Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“If the Republic dared to marginalize this Empress beloved by her people, they would incur the full furor of the populace and risk mass insurrection.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“For their part, they would judge it wiser to preserve the Imperial institution rather than attempt to instate direct rule.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“And so, I played the part of a man who lusts only for power and approached the Republic with a proposition.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I even had little choice but to acquiesce to a Republican marriage proposal for Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"As a result, however, the Empire was able to cling on to its Imperial institution and governance.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Tokita Kanami, I have caused you untold suffering.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You have my apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You would... apologize now?”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you had only said so from the beginning, I would not have needed to hate you so...”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Kanami powerlessly murmurs, hanging her head.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How do you explain all the suffering you've caused the people?”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It was a means to the end of earning the\ngovernor-general's trust.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I was often required to provide him with significant funds.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You enriched yourself in the meanwhile though, didn't you?!”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You may find every last coin preserved in my estate.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I have no illusions that it will absolve my sins, but I pray that you will use it for the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How about you start by building graves for all those people you purged?”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The purges were another fabrication.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I approached all of the 'victims,' and after explaining my objectives, relocated them to Hokkaishu with a generous sum of money in compensation.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"Akari falls silent, and Hotori steps up to speak in her stead.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What of the subjugation of the warriors? Was that done for the sake of the Empire as well?”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“At every turn, I did everything in my power to impede the\nRepublic's repression of the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So cutting off our salaries and outlawing the possession of blades was for our own damn good?”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“If you think about it rationally, you will come to understand.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ridiculous.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah...!”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama indeed once remarked that the chancellor was always interfering with her public security measures.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That his schemes always ended up backfiring.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“There you have it.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Regarding Kokuan, the original plan was to lure you to a Republican military base.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It was only owing to my intervention that the site was changed to the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“If you had dared set foot into a Republican Army facility, you would not be here today.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Gh...”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It was also through my doing that Maki alone was present to encounter you in the dungeon.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“If I truly wished to crush the warriors, I would have made use of the countless opportunities at my disposal to do so.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"Hotori continues regarding Okonogi with a look of loathing on her face.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"Everything he's said makes logical sense.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"However, all of it might just be convenient rationalizations devised after the fact.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've got some nerve to spew all that after murdering my mother in cold blood!”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I, Okonogi Tokihiko, have always served Her Majesty with the utmost fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Never once have I ever considered bringing harm upon Her Majesty!”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"Okonogi fixes her with cloudless eyes that project a sincere force of will.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"─He speaks true.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"That is what my instincts tell me.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then why would you make me believe that you killed her?!”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you really were carrying out her will, you could have just said so!”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All you did was cause needless misunderstandings!”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It was all for the purpose of stoking your wrath, Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I believed that if the flames of vengeance did not burn bright within Your Highness's breast, it would soon be snuffed out by the heedless march of time.”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"People are weak.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			{
"Without strong emotions to fuel them, their resolve is sure to be washed away by time's ablation.",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Heheh... I should have known that such attempts to justify myself in the eleventh hour would not suffice to sway your hearts.”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“But that is well enough.”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“When we are done here, consider it my final act of service to offer my head to the people.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“With Empress Hisui's testimony, the populace will surely recognize Your Highness's claim as the true Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You don't have to tell me that.”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"Akari's enmity towards Okonogi has not diminished in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"Confronted with the person she believed for years was her\nmother's killer, expecting anything else would be unreasonable.",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Okonogi, I have one last question for you.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You must have known our whereabouts this whole time.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why did you leave us unattended, knowing that a day like today would come?”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"If he truly wished to hold on to his power, he had no reason to allow Akari to live.",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I most certainly did not.”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I've always been watching over you.”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“After the war, it was I who saved you when you were upon the threshold of death. You and your sister both.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"He saved me?",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"No, it was the manager who saved me.",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			{
"It couldn't be...",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You don't mean to say... the manager is...”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Acting under my authority.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“He was formerly Empress Suou's personal groundskeeper.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			{
"My mind reels at Okonogi's revelations.",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"Feeling neither the anger nor despair I was expecting, all I can do is stare up at the ceiling.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin, I have long awaited the day when your powers might return.”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What powers are you saying I have?”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“So you still cannot recall...”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It seems that today's uprising has come too soon.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Answer me! What am I capable of?”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You are...”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"A terrible screeching sound passes overhead.",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh?!”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"This sound─",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"My body moves on pure instinct.",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			{
"The audience chamber is engulfed in flames as its structural supports collapse beneath the deafening explosion.",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ahh...”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			{
"Akari's eyes are wide with shock.",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			{
"The mighty shockwave flings me about until I can't tell up from down.",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"One after another, a force like a colossal fist of iron strikes my back, but I never let go of the precious life within my arms.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			{
"Eventually, the ominous rumbling subsides as though it never happened.",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ugh... ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, are you okay?!”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah... somehow.”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Forget about me. What about everyone else?”",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			{
"I let go of Akari and survey the surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			{
"Did... Did everyone...",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"The first sight I come across is Okonogi, laying buried under a heap of rubble.",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi?!”",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"Akari rushes up to him with a gasp.",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			{
"The entire left side of his body has been completely flattened.",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			{
"Even before our very eyes, a crimson pool of blood slowly seeps out from beneath the rubble.",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Heh... Heheh... What an honor it is to die... in the same manner as Empress Suou...”",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"The building lets out another ominous groan.",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It is unsafe here!”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni, pull back now!”",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wait a second!”",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Your Highness... Take this...”",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			{
"He reaches a trembling hand up to his own eyeball and gouges it out without any hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your false eye?”",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It was entrusted to me... by Empress Suou...”",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You will need it... to obtain the true Treasures...”",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The true Treasures...?”",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Does that mean the Treasures in the Shireiden are fakes?!”",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The Treasures as you know them... are nothing more than mere trinkets...”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The truth lies... within the Shireiden...”",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			{
"Okonogi coughs up a large mouthful of blood.",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Your Highness...”",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Go to Iseya... and hone... Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi?!”",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			{
"Okonogi breathes one last rasping breath and falls still.",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, we have to go!”",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			{
"I drag Akari to her feet.",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Your Highness...”",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“...The future of the Empire... rests in your...”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
		next={ block=395, label=7 },
	},
}
